{
  "about": "관리 > 출/퇴근기록부(사원)(E020726) — [신규(F2)] 창에서 사원 · 시간(오늘 09:00)을 넣고 [출근] 하면 달력 오늘 칸에 '1(1 + 0)'. 같은 사원으로 [신규(F2)]에서 다시 [출근]하면 원본처럼 '출근시간이 입력되어 있습니다.' 로 막힌다(2026-10-13 실측). 퇴근은 [리스트]에서 [일자]를 눌러 연 창의 [퇴근] — 사원은 막혀 있고 외근 칸이 없으며 오른쪽에 '▸ [출근 …]' 이력. 18:00 으로 퇴근하면 리스트에 출근 · 퇴근시간 · 내근. 선택삭제('선택한 사원의 근무기록을 삭제하겠습니까?')로 지운다. 2026-10-13 2차: 달력 날짜 칸을 누르면 그 날짜로 [출근] 창, 'n(내근 + 외근)'을 누르면 그날 목록 창. 퇴근 창은 □오후반차설정. 퇴근 뒤 다시 [출근]하면 줄은 하나 그대로, 퇴근시간 옆 '+1'.",
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "날짜 칸 → 출근 → 그날 목록 창 → 퇴근(오후반차) → 다시 출근(+1) → 삭제",
      "path": "/hr/employee-commutes",
      "steps": [
        "allowapi:409: /api/hr/employee-commutes/clock",
        "js:window.confirm=()=>true;(()=>{const d=new Date();sessionStorage.setItem('qaEcDay',d.getFullYear()+'-'+String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')+'-'+String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0'));return true})()",
        "js:(()=>{document.querySelector('td[data-date=\"'+sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'\"]').click();return true})()",
        "wait:400",
        "expect:(()=>{const d=document.querySelector('[role=dialog]');return [...d.querySelectorAll('button')].some(b=>b.textContent==='출근')&&d.querySelector('input[type=datetime-local]').value.startsWith(sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay'))&&d.innerText.includes('오전반차설정')})()",
        "clicklast:닫기",
        "wait:300",
        "click:신규(F2)",
        "pick:사원:EMP-0001",
        "js:(()=>{const el=document.querySelector('[role=dialog] input[type=datetime-local]');Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLInputElement.prototype,'value').set.call(el,sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'T09:00');el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));el.dispatchEvent(new Event('change',{bubbles:true}));return true})()",
        "setnear:사유|QA관리-출근",
        "clicklast:출근",
        "wait:1200",
        "expect:[...document.querySelectorAll('table tbody td')].some(td=>td.querySelector('div')?.textContent===String(Number(sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay').slice(8)))&&/\\d+\\(\\d+ \\+ \\d+\\)/.test(td.innerText))",
        "click:신규(F2)",
        "pick:사원:EMP-0001",
        "js:(()=>{const el=document.querySelector('[role=dialog] input[type=datetime-local]');Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLInputElement.prototype,'value').set.call(el,sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'T10:00');el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));return true})()",
        "expect:[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] button')].some(b=>b.textContent==='출근')&&![...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] button')].some(b=>b.textContent==='퇴근')",
        "clicklast:출근",
        "wait:1000",
        "expect:document.querySelector('[role=dialog]').innerText.includes('출근시간이 입력되어 있습니다.')&&document.querySelector('[role=dialog]').innerText.includes('해당 일자를 클릭하여 퇴근시간을 입력바랍니다.')",
        "clicklast:닫기",
        "wait:300",
        "js:(()=>{const a=document.querySelector('td[data-date=\"'+sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'\"] a');a.click();return true})()",
        "wait:800",
        "expect:(()=>{const d=document.querySelector('[role=dialog]');return d.innerText.includes('입력 후')||!!d.querySelector('input[placeholder=\"입력 후 [Enter]\"]')})()&&!![...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'))",
        "js:(()=>{const tr=[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'));tr.querySelector('a').click();return true})()",
        "wait:500",
        "expect:(()=>{const d=document.querySelector('[role=dialog]');return [...d.querySelectorAll('button')].some(b=>b.textContent==='퇴근')&&d.querySelector('input[aria-label=사원코드]').disabled&&!d.innerText.includes('외근')&&d.innerText.includes('오후반차설정')&&d.innerText.includes('▸ [출근 ')&&d.innerText.includes('오전 9:00]')})()",
        "js:(()=>{const el=document.querySelector('[role=dialog] input[type=datetime-local]');Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLInputElement.prototype,'value').set.call(el,sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'T18:00');el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));return true})()",
        "js:(()=>{const l=[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] label')].find(x=>x.innerText.includes('오후반차설정'));l.querySelector('input').click();return true})()",
        "clicklast:퇴근",
        "wait:1200",
        "expect:[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'))?.innerText.includes('오후 6:00:00')",
        "js:(()=>{const tr=[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'));tr.querySelector('a').click();return true})()",
        "wait:500",
        "expect:(()=>{const d=document.querySelector('[role=dialog]');return [...d.querySelectorAll('button')].some(b=>b.textContent==='출근')&&d.innerText.includes('▸ [퇴근 ')&&d.innerText.includes('오전반차설정')})()",
        "js:(()=>{const el=document.querySelector('[role=dialog] input[type=datetime-local]');Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(HTMLInputElement.prototype,'value').set.call(el,sessionStorage.getItem('qaEcDay')+'T19:00');el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));return true})()",
        "clicklast:출근",
        "wait:1200",
        "expect:[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'))?.innerText.includes('+1')",
        "js:(()=>{const tr=[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].find(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'));tr.querySelector('input[type=checkbox]').click();return true})()",
        "js:[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] button')].find(b=>b.textContent==='선택삭제').click()||true",
        "wait:1200",
        "expect:![...document.querySelectorAll('[role=dialog] table tbody tr')].some(t=>t.innerText.includes('오전 9:00:00'))",
        "clicklast:닫기"
      ]
    }
  ]
